{"2440760":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"GRAVHOUNDS","steam_appid":2440760,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GRAVHOUNDS is a 1–4 player co-op action builder. Drop into hostile planets as a pack, build and defend your base in physics-driven mayhem, and extract with everything you can carry before you become alien chow! The longer you stay, the greater the danger... and the rewards.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/57756b6a5313e8159dac2a24074d41bd.webp?t=1793732699\" width=617 height=57 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/c46a2176c9b9dce30377db99f1783ffd.poster.avif?t=1793732699\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/c46a2176c9b9dce30377db99f1783ffd.webm?t=1793732699\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/c46a2176c9b9dce30377db99f1783ffd.mp4?t=1793732699\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense alone, chaotic with a crew. Combine each Gravhound's strengths and improvise to beat back the swarm. Go lone wolf to expand the operation or stick with the pack and stand your ground.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/7124ada6192ef454199e5470d40ba322.webp?t=1793732699\" width=617 height=57 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/ce2503eadc6a7d515ca07063eb4c87ac.poster.avif?t=1793732699\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/ce2503eadc6a7d515ca07063eb4c87ac.webm?t=1793732699\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/ce2503eadc6a7d515ca07063eb4c87ac.mp4?t=1793732699\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fetch!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fling objects across the battlefield to your teammates. Turn gravity against the swarm and send them flying, one by one.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disclaimer: Transporting volatile materials with the Grav Beam may result in unforeseen loss of Gravhounds.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/da990cfae570221a451d01475fc26a5d.webp?t=1793732699\" width=617 height=57 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/d6098381f45dff17194e5e5fac635afa.poster.avif?t=1793732699\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/d6098381f45dff17194e5e5fac635afa.webm?t=1793732699\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/d6098381f45dff17194e5e5fac635afa.mp4?t=1793732699\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy turrets, generators, and fabricators to expand the operation and defend it from the swarm.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extend pipelines across hostile terrain to power your base, move resources, and keep your escape route alive.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/bdfd7245fdbad0997d0aba6e1247fe79.webp?t=1793732699\" width=617 height=57 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/ed5d2bc690ad048aa85f6531045857f1.poster.avif?t=1793732699\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/ed5d2bc690ad048aa85f6531045857f1.webm?t=1793732699\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/ed5d2bc690ad048aa85f6531045857f1.mp4?t=1793732699\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a crew of bio-engineered canine workers built for dangerous planetary operations.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loyal.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obedient.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expendable.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/dc18a33eef7f4fbe1c9f2ac502bdbb29.webp?t=1793732699\" 