d reposition under fire. Race to your teammates' aid or make a last dash for materials.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: Unauthorized recreational use of pipeline boost is strictly prohibited.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/a1dd2922565c9625f3b71bd5ac403f84.webp?t=1793732699\" width=617 height=57 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/ad5470103d31cf98cca10c39010fbaa5.poster.avif?t=1793732699\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/ad5470103d31cf98cca10c39010fbaa5.webm?t=1793732699\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/ad5470103d31cf98cca10c39010fbaa5.mp4?t=1793732699\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out treacherous planets for the best materials - the higher the risk, the greater the rewards.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new Gravhounds, weapons, and upgrade paths.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay longer, push harder, and the swarm escalates. Every shift becomes a bet on how much your pack can handle.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/830f3f8e04099b85a275e9f81484331a.webp?t=1793732699\" width=617 height=57 \/><\/span><\/h2><p 