9ed50b24.mp4?t=1793732699\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost in any direction and reposition under fire. Race to your teammates' aid or make a last dash for materials.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: Unauthorized recreational use of pipeline boost is strictly prohibited.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/a1dd2922565c9625f3b71bd5ac403f84.webp?t=1793732699\" width=617 height=57 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/ad5470103d31cf98cca10c39010fbaa5.poster.avif?t=1793732699\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/ad5470103d31cf98cca10c39010fbaa5.webm?t=1793732699\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/ad5470103d31cf98cca10c39010fbaa5.mp4?t=1793732699\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out treacherous planets for the best materials - the higher the risk, the greater the rewards.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new Gravhounds, weapons, and upgrade paths.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay longer, push harder, and the swarm escalates. Every shift becomes a bet on how much your pack can handle.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/extras\/830f3f8e04099b85a275e9f81484331a.webp?t=1793732699\" width=617 height=57 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Far from home.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swarm closing in.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still expected to hit quota.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get to work.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"GRAVHOUNDS is a 1–4 player co-op action builder. Drop into hostile planets as a pack, build and defend your base in physics-driven mayhem, and extract with everything you can carry before you become alien chow! The longer you stay, the greater the danger... and the rewards.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/defc2295485abc77e8989ebef77b0ac900750bf9\/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1793732699","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/45bf181cc256585288c15fcdc16b82959677f8b2\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793732699","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2440760\/45bf181cc256585288c15fcdc16b82959677f8b2\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793732699","website":"https:\/\/gravhounds.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-BIT Required)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-7600K or AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1660 or AMD Radeon RX 590<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><